<mo>\u2212</mo><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>\u2202</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>\u2202</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>\u2202</mi><mrow><mi>\u2202</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">\u2061</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>\u2212</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>\u2212</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Hence, the normal vector to the tangent plane is </p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"120\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E8\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.222em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx